copyName is operation
copyName purpose "Copy a zone name from UTF-16 (its low bytes) to a 16-byte buffer: at most 15 characters and a 0; a name of more than five characters with spaces in it (Windows names its zones `Eastern Standard Time`) is written as the capitals that start its words (EST), as the C library's abbreviations are"
copyName invariant abbreviates "\"A name with words becomes the capitals that start them, any other name is copied up to 15 characters\""
