asctimeInto is operation
asctimeInto purpose "asctime_r's text for a struct tm, with its 0 byte, in a buffer of a size: weekday and month names, the day in 3 columns, hour, minute, and second in 2 digits, the year, and a line feed; the buffer, or the address 0 with EOVERFLOW when the text would not fit (a weekday or month out of range is ???)"
asctimeInto invariant writesText "\"Writes the 25 characters and a line feed asctime gives, or gives the address 0 when they do not fit\""
